\title "The capo is set in the Tuning panel"
\ts (4 4)
\tuning (D4 A3 G3 D3 A2 D2)
0.6.4{txt "Tab view. 1. Double-click DADGAD tuning in the head: the Tuning panel opens"}
  0.5.4{txt "2. Under Capo, press + four times"}
  0.4.4{txt "The head reads DADGAD tuning · Capo 4th fret; these 0s stay 0s"}
  0.3.4{txt "3. Esc, then Space: the open strings sound four frets higher"} |
0.2.4{txt "4. Ctrl/⌘+Z: the capo is gone, and the tuning is still DADGAD"}
  0.1.4{txt "5. Open the panel again and type 15 in Capo: it reads 12"}
  0.2.4{txt "6. Clear the field and press Enter: it reads None, and the head has no capo"}
  0.3.4 |

